      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Isabelle Huppert's Parisian apartment, Gabriel drops by to ensure his exhausted star actress is finally resting. Instead of relaxing in bed, Isabelle confesses that she is secretly filming an experimental indie project in her living room. Let's listen to their conversation in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Comment ça va, toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Je m'en veux un peu.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
