    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's explore the dialogue line by line and examine the French phrases.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Comment ça va, toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How are you doing?' Gabriel asks Isabelle warmly as he arrives at her home.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Je m'en veux un peu.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I blame myself a little.' Isabelle admits she feels guilty about exhausting herself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "L'assurance va couvrir l'interruption?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will the insurance cover the shutdown?' Isabelle worries about the financial consequences of interrupting the shoot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Ce n'est pas ton problème.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not your problem.' Gabriel reassures her that financial matters belong to the producers.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Tu te reposes à la maison.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You rest at home.' Gabriel insists she take care of herself and stay in bed.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Je ne bouge plus maintenant.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not moving anymore now.' Isabelle promises she will not leave the apartment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Mais tu fais quoi, là?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But what are you doing here?' Gabriel suddenly spots film equipment and cameras in her living room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Tu tournes un film chez toi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you shooting a movie at home?' Gabriel realizes in disbelief that a film crew is present.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "C'est un petit film expérimental.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a small experimental film.' Isabelle explains the artistic nature of the spontaneous project.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "On fait ça vite fait.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are doing this quickly.' Isabelle describes the informal speed of the low-budget production.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Il faut que tu te reposes.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You need to rest.' Gabriel reminds her firmly of her doctor's orders.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Mais nous nous amusons tellement.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But we are having so much fun.' Isabelle defends her passion for filmmaking without commercial pressure.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Pas de contrat, pas de producteur.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No contract, no producer.' Isabelle celebrates the pure freedom of making cinema without bureaucracy.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "isabelle",
      "t": "Juste la caméra et moi.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just the camera and me.' Isabelle concludes with poetic dedication to her lifelong craft. Now let's listen to the entire dialogue once more to consolidate the expressions.",
